# L §2.2 (writer 8): first_business is gone from the built-ins ("The n-th business day of a period p is
# add_business(start_of(p) - 1 day, n, cal)", L §4.2); a call takes a built-in's name or a band's id (L §2.3 Calls),
# so first_business(...) names no band: LOAD-NAME.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input len: calendar

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  len = calendar(weekends [sat, sun])

ask q: first_business(2026-03, 1, len)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-NAME ...
